1
00:00:00,003 --> 00:00:03,343
(Penny:)Oh, no, no, no. Crystals don't work.

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:06,220
Really? That's the line?

3
00:00:06,384 --> 00:00:09,014
(Leonard:)Psychics are real,
but crystals are voodoo?

4
00:00:09,179 --> 00:00:12,719
(Penny:)Oh, voodoo's real.
You don't wanna mess with voodoo.

5
00:00:15,226 --> 00:00:17,766
(Martha:)Flatland is more
than just a mathematical essay.

6
00:00:17,937 --> 00:00:21,027
(Martha:)It is also a treatise
on Victorian social mores.

7
00:00:21,191 --> 00:00:24,571
(Raj:)You know,
I had never considered that.

8
00:00:26,905 --> 00:00:31,075
Wow. I mean, that's going
to completely change my visits there.

9
00:00:31,242 --> 00:00:32,412
[LAUGHS]

10
00:00:40,085 --> 00:00:43,465
(Sheldon:)-Well, it's late.
-Uh-huh.

11
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,050
(Sheldon:)Time for bed.

12
00:00:45,882 --> 00:00:47,762
(Raj:)Okay.

13
00:00:49,928 --> 00:00:51,598
(Sheldon:)Good night, puny human.

14
00:01:02,899 --> 00:01:03,939
(Martha:)Sheldon?

15
00:01:11,032 --> 00:01:12,322
(Sheldon:)Yes?

16
00:01:12,492 --> 00:01:16,282
(Martha:)Listen, they're kind of getting busy
in the living room...

17
00:01:16,454 --> 00:01:19,954
(Martha:)...and I was wondering
if I could hang out in here for a while.

18
00:01:21,417 --> 00:01:24,127
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose. Come in.

19
00:01:29,717 --> 00:01:32,637
(Sheldon:)I'll sleep in Leonard's room.
Good night.

